    "start": 296.085,
    "end": 303.647,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "And as such, mention is made here then, that if you quickly, if you continue this practice as much as you're able,",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
