    "end": 334.299,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Translator",
    "text": "putting a great deal of effort into it, then you will quickly and surely acquire a confident realization that confusion then is freed by itself.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_29",
    "start": 334.379,
    "end": 341.288,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Translator",
    "text": "So the confusion then of grasping at the seemingly true existence of things will naturally be set free by itself.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_30",
    "start": 350.502,
    "end": 355.585,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Translator",
    "text": "It is very helpful then, we read, to mingle your mind inseparably with your teachers.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
