    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_70",
    "start": 650.661,
    "end": 655.924,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think the view has to be vast and our conduct has to be very thoroughly, very fine.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_71",
    "start": 670.349,
    "end": 676.853,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Translator",
    "text": "As such, especially guard the continuity of impermanence, renunciation and pure discipline, like your own eyes.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_72",
    "start": 677.613,
    "end": 684.217,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Translator",
    "text": "Never diminish your one-pointed diligence in the heart of the matter, the essential yoga of profound meaning.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_73",
    "start": 684.877,
    "end": 698.245,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
    "verified_speaker": "Translator",
    "text": "As such, it is imperative at all times and in all situations to apply single-pointed diligence at the heart of the matter, to essentialize or to actualize this essential yoga of profound meaning.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_74",
    "start": 699.991,
    "end": 702.113,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So, Khyentse Rinpoche always emphasizes on",
