    "end": 740.568,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "If we just listen to so many Dharmas and then we don't contemplate, we don't think about, then it becomes my diet book.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_81",
    "start": 742.617,
    "end": 748.72,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I have so many diet books and I'm still quite heavy.",
