    "start": 768.042,
    "end": 774.646,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So maybe you don't need too many diet books, but one good diet book, and if you follow it, you will lose weight.",
