    "end": 998.196,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So, emotion is also thoughts.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_114",
    "start": 1000.144,
    "end": 1009.416,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "I have some friends who didn't do much practice and then suddenly they had some emotional problem and then comes to me and say how to meditate.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_115",
    "start": 1010.377,
    "end": 1014.042,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So then it's difficult when you're already like ups and downs.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "SRR_001_116",
    "start": 1015.003,
    "end": 1015.805,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think we have to",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
