    "start": 1017.922,
    "end": 1031.57,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "when everything is sort of okay, we have to practice, practice, and once we really get quite familiar with this practice, then emotion will not bother so much.",
