    "end": 1079.533,
    "original_speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
    "verified_speaker": "Rinpochoe",
    "text": "So I think what we need is previously practice, practice, and then get familiar with it, and then naturally all the problems related with your mind will naturally be less and disappear.",
    "include_in_corpus": null,
    "exclusion_reason": null
  },
  {
